variant Tie
newest oldest

variant Rounding
even_half upper_half

record Ranking
mode:{Tie} first_id:i next_id:i

smaller left:i right:i > i
if (< left right) left right

larger left:i right:i > i
if (> left right) left right

even_units whole:i > i
if (eq (mod whole 2) 0) whole (+ whole 1)

upper_units whole:i > i
+ whole 1
